OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTurning
OL,6,Fincreasingly cloudy from the west
OL,7,Fduring the evening with outbreaks of
OL,8,Flight and patchy rain potentially
OL,9,Fpushing across the region later.
OL,10,FMilder overnight with light easterly
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FTurning warm and humid on
OL,14,FMonday. Some sunshine developing
OL,15,Fthough the day, though an increasing
OL,16,Fchance of showers later, and overnight
OL,17,Fwith the odd heavy possibly thundery
OL,18,Fshower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
